        "created_at": "2016-06-10T15:36:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Featureless blocks and cylinders don't get my juices flowing. &nbsp;However, a meeple-tastic add-on/upgrade for the Kickstarter like <a href=\"https://www.meeplesource.com/proddetail.php?prod=DominantSpeciesComplete\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">meeplesource.com has for Dominant Species</a> would be fantastic (with aliens rather than monkeys, butterflies, spiders, snakes, etc. of course):</p><p>![](upload://zBjrnW9sSxLekOyB59EjeZpUGvh.jpeg)</p><p>The Pandemic germ set would be great for life before it's evolved:</p><p>![](upload://b8XrPg3PIoXSOV99pfeOxQGRoBO.jpeg)</p><p>Each evolved species could be different from each other:</p><p>![](upload://9mg2kopO6cai0GxGPCU3RlwsQsf.jpeg)![](upload://3ohpqHkXG1Oe3rvWzZpcDRHRQA3.jpeg)![](upload://5OX2m3Ri6RCf4mdVtOIpwWVvUuq.jpeg)![](upload://kVXKRHINdOJJlAbxswzlTk4kwqk.jpeg)![](upload://lzoGQ0ZULnrHAaTgaqs9dCOcHVO.jpeg)</p><p>I'm just saying, there are a world of meeple-tastic opportunities out there.</p>",
