        "raw": "<p>Featureless blocks and cylinders don&#39;t get my juices flowing. &nbsp;However, a meeple-tastic add-on/upgrade for the Kickstarter like <a href=\"https://www.meeplesource.com/proddetail.php?prod=DominantSpeciesComplete\">meeplesource.com has for Dominant Species</a> would be fantastic (with aliens rather than monkeys, butterflies, spiders, snakes, etc. of course):</p><p>![](upload://zBjrnW9sSxLekOyB59EjeZpUGvh.jpeg)</p><p>The Pandemic germ set would be great for life before it&#39;s evolved:</p><p>![](upload://b8XrPg3PIoXSOV99pfeOxQGRoBO.jpeg)</p><p>Each evolved species could be different from each other:</p><p>![](upload://9mg2kopO6cai0GxGPCU3RlwsQsf.jpeg)![](upload://3ohpqHkXG1Oe3rvWzZpcDRHRQA3.jpeg)![](upload://5OX2m3Ri6RCf4mdVtOIpwWVvUuq.jpeg)![](upload://kVXKRHINdOJJlAbxswzlTk4kwqk.jpeg)![](upload://lzoGQ0ZULnrHAaTgaqs9dCOcHVO.jpeg)</p><p>I&#39;m just saying, there are a world of meeple-tastic opportunities out there.</p>",
